  "description": "A GUI-less version of Bio .NET library for editing & annotating various microscopy image formats. Supports all bioformats supported images. Integrates with ImageJ, running ImageJ filters & macro functions. Supports Windows, Linux and Mac.",
  "iconFile": "banner.jpg",
